# test: a flat chain of 1000 `else if` branches checks and runs, since its branches are siblings
# Spec 02 Source Files And Suites: "An implementation may limit how deeply brackets, suites,
# closures, and string interpolations nest within one another." Spec 06 Conditional Expressions:
# "`else if` is one conditional-chain form. It is not parsed as an `else` suite containing an
# unrelated nested `if`."
